   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture Business Challenge (HBC): Program Development and Kick-off</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Equip twelve (12) tertiary students/young professionals in agriculture with practical training, problem-solving skills, and invaluable industry insights. 
2.	Provide a platform for tertiary students to interact with industry experts
3.	Acquire feasible solutions to real-life business challenges  
4.	Train participants in relevant soft and digital skills to thrive within the sector</narrative>
   </description>
