   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">End of Year Report on Horticulture Business Challenge 2nd Edition</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">This report provides a review of the second edition of the HBC. It documents the results of interviews and
surveys conducted after the program to evaluate its immediate outcomes and identify areas for
improvement. The report begins with an overview of the HBC and its objectives. Chapter 2 outlines the
key elements of the 2024 edition, including the recruitment and selection process and the structure of the 10-day program. Chapter 3 discusses the evaluation methodology and summarizes feedback from participants. Chapter 4 highlights the lessons learned from implementing the program, while Chapter 5 presents recommendations for future editions.</narrative>
